    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the world of Dracamar!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Embark on a 3D platformer adventure and fight King Crad, the evil dragon who wants to conquer the world of Dracamar. Run, jump, and battle to rescue the magical Okis.<i>\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Catalan culture inspires the world of Dracamar, and the game is available to play in Catalan.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306480/extras/c4687333b25e0df9b421768572f5b8f3.poster.avif?t=1744822574\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306480/extras/c4687333b25e0df9b421768572f5b8f3.webm?t=1744822574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306480/extras/c4687333b25e0df9b421768572f5b8f3.mp4?t=1744822574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Friends that travel together, stay together!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Travel and explore all the islands and free the Okis. Collect Moki-balls and use their energy to rebuild the bridges and connect the islands again.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306480/extras/eecf1992618bebb42f68f60a2194994f.poster.avif?t=1744822574\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306480/extras/eecf1992618bebb42f68f60a2194994f.webm?t=1744822574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306480/extras/eecf1992618bebb42f68f60a2194994f.mp4?t=1744822574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Heroes come in all shapes and sizes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iko is a very special Oki. He will follow you on your adventures and help you defeat King Crad with his magical powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306480/extras/ce0ba9d6c543d547e922b4a38fe6d523.poster.avif?t=1744822574\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306480/extras/ce0ba9d6c543d547e922b4a38fe6d523.webm?t=1744822574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306480/extras/ce0ba9d6c543d547e922b4a38fe6d523.mp4?t=1744822574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautifully-rendered graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 playable characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 levels full of enemies, traps, challenges, and puzzles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover all kinds of hidden gems, challenges, and collectibles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to delight and challenge players of all ages and skill levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Co-Op: Play with your family and friends.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A production by<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306480/extras/992b309e312f5134c45a0abfcbff40ad.webp?t=1744822574\" width=200 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in collaboration with<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306480/extras/6d88c53a8d2ab645ba7656f54a6b7fe3.avif?t=1744822574\" width=150 height=104 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the world of Dracamar!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Embark on a 3D platformer adventure and fight King Crad, the evil dragon who wants to conquer the world of Dracamar. Run, jump, and battle to rescue the magical Okis.<i>\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Catalan culture inspires the world of Dracamar, and the game is available to play in Catalan.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306480/extras/c4687333b25e0df9b421768572f5b8f3.poster.avif?t=1744822574\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306480/extras/c4687333b25e0df9b421768572f5b8f3.webm?t=1744822574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306480/extras/c4687333b25e0df9b421768572f5b8f3.mp4?t=1744822574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Friends that travel together, stay together!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Travel and explore all the islands and free the Okis. Collect Moki-balls and use their energy to rebuild the bridges and connect the islands again.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306480/extras/eecf1992618bebb42f68f60a2194994f.poster.avif?t=1744822574\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306480/extras/eecf1992618bebb42f68f60a2194994f.webm?t=1744822574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306480/extras/eecf1992618bebb42f68f60a2194994f.mp4?t=1744822574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Heroes come in all shapes and sizes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iko is a very special Oki. He will follow you on your adventures and help you defeat King Crad with his magical powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306480/extras/ce0ba9d6c543d547e922b4a38fe6d523.poster.avif?t=1744822574\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306480/extras/ce0ba9d6c543d547e922b4a38fe6d523.webm?t=1744822574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306480/extras/ce0ba9d6c543d547e922b4a38fe6d523.mp4?t=1744822574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautifully-rendered graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 playable characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 levels full of enemies, traps, challenges, and puzzles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover all kinds of hidden gems, challenges, and collectibles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to delight and challenge players of all ages and skill levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Co-Op: Play with your family and friends.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A production by<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306480/extras/992b309e312f5134c45a0abfcbff40ad.webp?t=1744822574\" width=200 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in collaboration with<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306480/extras/6d88c53a8d2ab645ba7656f54a6b7fe3.avif?t=1744822574\" width=150 height=104 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Join Caliu, Foc, and Espurna on a journey full of adventures in the magical island world of Dracamar. Run, jump, and fight to free the Okis. Collect all the Moki-balls to rebuild the bridges and reconnect the islands. Get ready to fight the evil King Crad and save the world with your friends!",
